{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d59fa8f9cbddef56aadf3795c9c0558b8b8617128fa393a454f75103d698509", "ja": "（なんと、プロレス団体からオファーが来た！\n新人興行でステージをやってほしいとの事だが……）", "zh": "（真没想到职业摔角团体会发来工作邀约！\n听说是想在新人演出上请我们去表演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0a132575f3ad3bd87e95dd7d7feece00f08bc25be322bfc4074f805b470e4358", "ja": "（メンバーは誰がいいだろう？\nまずはセンターを決めないと……）", "zh": "（成员要选谁好呢？\n首先必须决定Center的人选……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "d0cb7eda4ca3a0500fa6592a58ef8ce2112c9d014549bf481bfe6b0260fa32df", "ja": "痛そうかぁ……たしかにそうかも。\n桃子ちゃんには、ちょっと刺激が強かったかな？", "zh": "看起来很痛是吗……好像真的是这样呢。\n这对桃子来说，可能有点太刺激了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "68cc9a8fa0e359bfd335dada8986169d6f27c77f0b1dc1c21968af1cdc2de03c", "ja": "でも、機会があったら見てみるといいと思う！\n私も初めて見たけど、すごく感動したから。", "zh": "不过，如果有机会，我还是建议你可以看一下！\n因为我虽然也是第一次看摔角，但真的觉得很感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "097d184871efbd83ee3da50ed23cdfa3260388ed2ca7f3ec6b8aa026d5efae41", "ja": "プロレスって乱暴なイメージかもしれないけど、\nそれだけじゃないんだよ！　何て言えばいいのかな～。", "zh": "或许职业摔角给人很粗暴的印象，\n其实不只是这样喔！该怎么讲才好呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e57445f9e768d6c505ea09bdb1b26a4a8e5d8e99659bee4ae9f66845c50c53e3", "ja": "うーん……とにかく熱くて、見てる人が\n元気になれるような……そういう力のある……。", "zh": "唔……总之就是很热血，会带给观众活力……\n一定要充满这种力量才可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "f0f45331aa4c11713ae21938432cbc85f4cb61b906f47d52e4abab1ae5484973", "ja": "おっ！？　{$P$}、さすが！\nわかってるねっ！", "zh": "哦！？真不愧是{$P$}！\n你很懂嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad804e782d473c20893691bbd8224528e3866b3f429ab7385d8d9c9bb1e125e9", "ja": "そう、そうなんだよ！　熱くて、元気になれるの！\n応援したくなるし、力をもらえるって感じでさ！", "zh": "没有错，你完全说对了！就是既热血又能带给人活力！\n会让人忍不住就想帮忙加油打气，自己也从中获得力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a148cae6c23c9dbc04f7cfa6277637fea7539de712f175e44cb3cd8b842f0b78", "ja": "応援したくなる……なるほど。\n新人公演だし、そういう要素も必要だろうな。", "zh": "会想帮忙加油打气吗……原来如此。\n毕竟是新人公演，这种要素也是必须的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "9fb7787d078ab1d821830d31efb191327f8802557cddbade0fd143998e595e11", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ。\nふたりがそこまで言うなら、今度、見てもいいかも。", "zh": "哦～是这样吗。\n既然你们都说到这个地步了，桃子下次就去看看好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2a3fdc73d46c9528eb871fd6298f25d478bd43829ceee13948e7fdd1eab94947", "ja": "ん？\n……みんな、何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？\n……你们是在聊什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "73c28a502c2498d2debe3e7114550645f4b5cde70737805b4e91b60ac287f20c", "ja": "プロレスの話です！\n私たちのお仕事にも、関わることかもしれないので。", "zh": "在聊职业摔角啊！\n毕竟这也可能和我们的工作产生关联。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1012_p", "source_sha256": "45ee5c6d359a9f3a63623b569dc6bd72467d60c2da96870b01fbcbe25aebe05d", "ja": "えっ……どこからその情報を？", "zh": "咦……你从哪里知道这个消息的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "9dd8e9328ffc45c0d7118b4b9d6a4db9744d2b09768efb13624960eff5487280", "ja": "ふっふっふ……プロレスに関することなら、\nアタシにまかせて！　情報通だからね！", "zh": "呵呵呵……只要提到职业摔角，\n就来问我吧！我消息很灵通的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1014_p", "source_sha256": "47c6072a3240351035aaf617a87ab7ad3d32a857f90b16cb31bf815b40540cfc", "ja": "そ、そうか……まあ、それなら話が早い。\nのり子ならピッタリだろうし、任せてもいいか？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……既然如此那话就好说了。\n我想法子你应该很适合吧，可以把这个责任交给你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "59960bbb930f58fa0a94f59182861160b57da643a8d43621d863f8d64d58b4bf", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}も行きたいの？\nいいよ、チケット取ってあげる！　楽しみだね♪", "zh": "咦，{$P$}你也想去吗？\n好啊，那我帮你买票！好期待喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "d7fbdb0f09671257f5f0b79e41ea85285070b8d4f253cd0887563ffbe085bd3a", "ja": "わっほーい！　お疲れさまです。\n真ちゃんとゲームのお仕事、行ってきましたよ！", "zh": "哇哦──！大家辛苦了。\n我和小真做完游戏的工作回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "0ea781760aa270f9417c8c8fedc7e24625864394f3bbf341cfaa6341031a9206", "ja": "美奈子って、ホントに格ゲー強いよね……。\nそれよりみんな、何の話してたんですか？", "zh": "美奈子打格斗游戏真的很强欸……\n不说这个了，你们刚才在聊什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f598e6561042228baf4ba844407363b7907a0f6cc248a4268a1744ec67cfee05", "ja": "お疲れさま、ふたりとも！\n実は、プロレス団体から出演依頼があって……。", "zh": "你们两位辛苦了！\n其实啊，是有职业摔角团体发来表演委托……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1020_p", "source_sha256": "868a97e6ba5f0fcab000f0672b8169f2bf294b00b435931e14e1a6bdcb2f351a", "ja": "リングで、公演をする事になったんだ。\n今、のり子にセンターをお願いしたとこだよ。", "zh": "这次要在擂台上公演，\n我刚拜托法子来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "797038c61dcbf8ac55063fc2f3732db8797b80bf534a79b33f5ec4ff17715a50", "ja": "え？\n{$P$}、センターって……。", "zh": "咦？\n{$P$}，你说Center是指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "fc7b8c220e889711cb72f64809c0f50087214fdb884e093fbb4acadd87eae385", "ja": "えええええーーーっ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦咦咦───！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8b6ef38f491852ed34399ca0b64f3086b15bfdc97cf84f10cc9a7f0ee2296875", "ja": "な、なんだ！？　どうしたんだ、のり子！", "zh": "什、什么！？怎么了，法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "838c7749a9f4ef51416a4b181384e8ded0ac2bfa07435709946d8cde4f870675", "ja": "な、なんで！？\nアタシ、センターなんて聞いてないよ！？", "zh": "为、为什么！？\n我根本没听说Center的事啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "95bc619d1e5120ae47088a49fedd0667088009a25d6b58d8b206a2c91c52b026", "ja": "の、のり子さん、落ち着いて！\nえっと。私たち、何か勘違いしてたのかな……？", "zh": "法、法子，你冷静一点！\n呃，我们之间是不是有什么误会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "b768cd74fca25fdd4cc6edf9f4147f586068c3de134ebd55ada6400baf0f9574", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃん？\n桃子たちにわかるように、ちゃんと説明して！", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥，\n你好好解释一下给桃子我们听啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1027_p", "source_sha256": "26ec732bc397e278e3b31071334ce96c7f19461e2634b6b999d3423f1bb1ddbb", "ja": "あ、ああ。プロレス団体の新人興行で、\nステージをやって欲しいって依頼があったんだ。", "zh": "好，好的。有一份委托希望我们\n能在职业摔角团体的新人演出中进行表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a4d5fc0a78114f95825c1b6632798b0a83f22507a4436f1950b0029ab909c5aa", "ja": "せっかくだから、\nのり子にセンターをって思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，\n我就想说让法子来当Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "47ffc54185d08354e59a416f4dc156749013f3c9823c7f7602ad5ebbba51460f", "ja": "わぁ……すごい！　プロレスのお仕事なんて、\nのり子さんにピッタリだと思います！", "zh": "哇……好棒喔！居然会有职业摔角的工作，\n一定很适合法子的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "4ef2a6e3ea06d6e2564e7b09008d99681602d2646d7065e296adfb8a5dd0c297", "ja": "そうだよ、のり子ちゃん。\nしかもセンターなんて、すごいなぁ～！", "zh": "就是说啊，小法。\n而且还是Center欸，好厉害喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "9cbfcf5cdd2ee9d1d8023059ff5f63c5232e9a23aa2a89793726c14b008758a7", "ja": "のり子ならきっと、プロレスの試合に負けない、\n熱いステージができるはずだよ！　ボクも応援する！", "zh": "有法子在，一定能打造出不输职业摔角比赛的热血表演！\n在下也会帮你加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "810eaf937f9594adcc34141efc76eabf0f79636e4859f821e70a18dc3c45779b", "ja": "うぅ……。\nでもさ、センターなんて、アタシ……！", "zh": "呜呜……\n可是要当Center欸，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "a683cf2e755bd198328644927f68f0bf6574085b1c81c7d8581b7237c816b228", "ja": "けど、こんなチャンスめったにないと思うよ？\n好きなことと仕事が重なるなんて、最高じゃないか！", "zh": "这种机会不是很难能可贵吗？\n喜欢的事物跟工作有所重叠，这不是很棒吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "c745485f7fc3eb202c32eecbfaf8639b189c983d4ddd3780aecb489a58d90076", "ja": "真……そっか。そうだよね。\nたしかに、言われてみればそうなのかも……。", "zh": "真……对欸，说的也是。\n听你这么一说，感觉确实如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ba7b0a8f8894719e3779a30e66cde04f6d1929db61138e4efa4e6900fbe1900b", "ja": "のり子、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "法子，那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "a0c12f58a2a225cd3e95cacccc14295db472f74e8da89d692637f01adeb3d38d", "ja": "う、うん。いきなりでビックリしちゃったけど、\n格闘技のお仕事、ずっとやってみたかったし。", "zh": "呃、嗯，虽然事出突然吓了我一跳，\n但我本来就一直很想试试看格斗技相关的工作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_037_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "08caf4e4762130d69e659674277635a76cd129816dea866dfeab638f9a540545", "ja": "アタシ、やってみるよ、{$P$}！\nううん、アタシにやらせてっ！", "zh": "我会试试看的，{$P$}！\n不对，请你让我当Center！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
